  "summary": "Malicious code in parseyaml (PyPI)",
  "details": "In this campaign, remote code is executed via a dependency pretending to be a YAML loader but embedding a special loader executing code from a provided file. During analysis, the code was just a stub.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-parseyaml\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - The malicious code is intentionally included in a dependency of the package\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote malicious script.\n\n",
